feat(home): Drive files and pictures on each koi

A saved fish's form gains an Attachments section through
home-attach.js, the Map's one copy: picture thumbnails from
/api/home/attachments/picture, other files as links, Upload on
press, and Reference for a pasted Drive or Docs link. Writes post
the fish's id, so its folder is Other/<pond> #<id>/<fish> #<id>
under home.drive_folder (sd:8112), and a rename keeps its files.
A new unsaved fish shows no section. Unset settings read as on
the Map. No new setting, route or copy.

Closes: sd:8147
